+/// lattice-gpui lab patch: with `GPUI_LAB_IGNORE_OCCLUSION` set, a window
+/// renders as if visible even when nothing of it is on screen (covered, on a
+/// locked or sleeping display). Lattice's perf lab measures WebKit the same
+/// way, with WebKit's occlusion detection turned off, in windows that are
